@startuml
title System Sequence Diagram: Log Expense
autonumber

note top
    System Sequence Diagram for Expense Tracking App
    Shows user interaction with system as a black box
end note

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System: openAddExpense()
activate System
System --> User: expense form
deactivate System

note right of User
    User fills in:
    • Amount: $45.50
    • Category: "Food"
    • Description: "Lunch with team"
    • Date: today's date
end note

loop [while adding expense details]
    User -> System: enterExpenseDetail(field, value)
    activate System
    System --> User: field updated
    deactivate System
end

User -> System: submitExpense(amount, category, description, date)
activate System

alt [all fields valid]
    System --> User: expense saved confirmation
    System --> User: updated expense list
else [validation fails]
    System --> User: error message("Please fill all required fields")
end

deactivate System

@enduml
